# SHA-256 of abap2UI5-local's .github/scripts/refresh_input.sh, which
# trigger_local.yaml executes IN THIS repository's workflow, with the
# ACTION_KEY_LOCAL deploy key already materialised in the checkout it came
# from. Whoever can write to abap2UI5-local can therefore choose what runs
# here, and until this pin existed nothing noticed.
#
# The script legitimately lives over there - abap2UI5-local's own monthly
# update_input.yaml runs the same one, and a single implementation of the
# refresh is the point. What is fixed here is only that a CHANGE to it has to
# be acknowledged on this side too: update this hash in the same pull request,
# and the diff says a script this repository executes has moved.
#
#   sha256sum .github/scripts/refresh_input.sh   (in abap2UI5-local)
